 *
 * Attack order for the next session: the TIME-ATTACK carrier together with
 * R10/R11/R12 (they must net to zero insns), then R7 (a quarter of the residue,
 * and the block is permuter-mangled so a clean rewrite has room), then the
 * frame slot (A127), then R1.
 */

